# Trivy allowlist for the build-push pipeline (PETPLAT-105).
#
# One CVE ID per line. Every entry needs a comment with the reason, who
# accepted it, and a review date, e.g.:
#
#   # openssl in eclipse-temurin:17 base; no fixed version yet; accepted 2026-09-23, review 2026-10-23
#   CVE-2026-00000
#
# Review scan results: Actions run > Summary shows per-service counts;
# download the trivy-<service> artifact for the full JSON/table report.
# Remove entries once a fixed base image is available.
